_sytDim_sq_eq_factorial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation.sum_sytDim_sq_eq_factorial","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/PlancherelNormalisation.lean#L107-L119","doc":"**The Plancherel normalisation**: `Σ_{λ ⊢ k} (f^λ)² = k!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation.sum_toFinset_eq_sum_natPartition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation.sum_toFinset_eq_sum_natPartition","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/PlancherelNormalisation.lean#L68-L105","doc":"**The reindexing**, over Mathlib's `Nat.Partition` (no dependency on the red custom-`Partition`\nfile): the enumerator's `Finset` sums like `Finset.univ`.\n\nGeneric in the codomain (2026-08-23): the `Finset.sum_bij` argument never looked at `ℕ`, and the\n`ℤ`-valued instance is what the content-square total `secondMomentKernel` needs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation.numSYT_diagram_eq_sytDim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation.numSYT_diagram_eq_sytDim","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/PlancherelNormalisation.lean#L55-L66","doc":"**The summand identity**: on the partition index the RSK weight `numSYT` is the kernel's\nhook-length dimension `sytDim` of the sorted parts. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation.sort_parts_toNatPartition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation.sort_parts_toNatPartition","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/PlancherelNormalisation.lean#L48-L53","doc":"Sorting recovers the list (it was already weakly decreasing). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation.toNatPartition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation.toNatPartition","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/PlancherelNormalisation.lean#L40-L46","doc":"A member of the enumerator, as a Mathlib partition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}